@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Maintainer" as U
participant "GitHub Actions" as H
participant "Delist Script" as S
participant "Registry" as R
participant "GitHub Pages" as P

U -> H: Trigger delist-plugins with plugin IDs
H -> S: node scripts/delist-plugins.mjs
S -> R: planPluginDelisting(registry, catalog, ids)
R --> S: delisting plan
S -> R: applyPluginDelisting (update registry + catalog)
H -> H: npm run build:explorer + npm test
H -> P: upload + deploy
P --> U: Plugin removed from catalog
note over R: The plugin record is retained, only its public listing is removed.
@enduml
